    <h3>Trolley</h3>
    <h4>Price for one-way: $3.00</h4>
    <p>
      The trolley is by far the most convenient route towards campus as one of the stops is directly
      on campus. If you are near a trolley station in San Diego, you will eventually be able to get
      into the blue line, where the trolley can take you to
      <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/PJ8tgcdhGtn3wnM9A">UC San Diego Central Campus</a>.
    </p>
    <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
      <img
        src="../../../assets\images\transit\ucsdTrain.png"
        alt="UCSD Train"
        class="img-fluid rounded shadow w-100"
      />
    </div>

    <br />

