    <h3>Amtrack/Coaster</h3>
    <h4>Price and schedule vary, so look at their respective website for more information:</h4>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://www.amtrak.com/home">Amtrack</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://gonctd.com/services/coaster-commuter-rail/">Coaster</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The stop for either transportation mode should be at Old Town or at Santa Fe depot, afterwards
      you take the MTS blue line north to UC San Diego. Amtrak and Coaster do have discounts for
      students, kids, elderly, veterans, and more. They also have occasional promotional discounts
      year round, so keep an eye out for that as well!
    </p>
